# the-odds-api.com - powers GET /events and GET /events/:id (fixtures and
# odds). Billed by request cost (markets x regions), reported via response
# headers - see src/providers/the-odds-api/client.ts's logQuota.
THE_ODDS_API_KEY=
# api-sports.io (football) - powers GET /events/:id/live for currently-live
# matches: scoreboard, key events (goals/cards/subs), and stats. Free tier
# is 100 requests/day - see the poll-interval comment in
# src/providers/api-sports/live-tracker-service.ts for the budget math.
API_SPORTS_KEY=
